# Iris Flower Classification

## Project Overview
This project uses Machine Learning to classify Iris flowers into three species:
- Iris-setosa
- Iris-versicolor
- Iris-virginica

## Dataset
The Iris dataset contains 150 flower samples with:
- Sepal Length
- Sepal Width
- Petal Length
- Petal Width
- Species

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

## Algorithm Used
K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)

## Project Steps
1. Data Loading
2. Data Exploration
3. Data Visualization
4. Train-Test Split
5. Model Training
6. Model Evaluation
7. Prediction

## Results
- Model Accuracy: 100%
- Successfully predicted flower species.

